This directory vendors the `ccl_segb` library for reading Apple SEGB record
files.

Origin : https://github.com/abrignoni/iLEAPP/tree/main/scripts/ccl_segb
Author : Alex Caithness, CCL Forensics
License: MIT (Copyright 2023, CCL Forensics) — see the license headers in
         ccl_segb.py, ccl_segb1.py, and ccl_segb2.py.

The files are vendored unmodified so FFS Explorer can parse SEGB files without an
external dependency. All credit for the SEGB parsing belongs to the original
authors.
